# Integration tests only (`npm run test:integration`).
# `npm test` does not connect to Postgres.
#
# Leave these unset to use the local socket: host /tmp, port 5432,
# the current OS user, admin database postgres.
# The suite creates and drops its own scratch database.
# The role needs CREATEDB and visibility of pg_stat_activity.
#
# AQI_TEST_PGHOST=
# AQI_TEST_PGPORT=
# AQI_TEST_PGUSER=
# AQI_TEST_PGPASSWORD=
# AQI_TEST_PGDATABASE=
#
# Or set one admin URL instead of the fields above. If both are set, the URL wins.
# Do not commit a real password.
# AQI_TEST_DATABASE_URL=
#
# EPA AirNow current-observation client (src/lib/v1/airnow.ts).
# Free tier. Leave this unset and the client does not call out: it returns
# airnow_api_key_missing and stores nothing. Do not commit a real key.
# AIRNOW_API_KEY=
